**Fee Structure Design**:

| User Type | Target Fee | Subsidy Mechanism | Annual Cost (1M users) |
|-----------|-----------|-------------------|------------------------|
| **Citizens (retail)** | ≤$0.001/tx | Treasury DAO covers 90% | $3.6M |
